# The rules screens opened from character select's rules header: the header
# says the rules, A opens Custom Rules, whose speech is the main menu tree's
# reader fed from character select's frame hook. Rules changed to Stock,
# each sub-screen visited and returned from, back to character select, the
# header saying the new rules, and a second visit opening with the hint
# again. Every wait is on a whole line, so a missing or changed one fails
# the run. Run with the default --scene title:
#   python tools/a11y/drive.py tools/a11y/css_rules.drive

# Title screen to the main menu (tools/a11y/main_menu.drive).
wait "state 0 scene 0$"
press Start until "boot scene: game mode"
press A until "boot scene: state 0 scene 1$"
wait '"Main Menu\. 1-P Mode\. '
sleep 1

# VS. Mode, Melee.
press Down
wait '"VS\. Mode\. '
press A
wait '"VS\. Mode\. Melee\. '
sleep 0.3
press A
wait '"Character select\. Player 1, no character\."'
sleep 1

# Fox for player 1, which leaves the hand free.
press DUp
wait ': "Player 1: closed"$'
press DUp
wait ': "Pichu"$'
press DUp
wait ': "Fox"$'
wait 'glide to "Fox" ended after \d+ frames: arrived'
press A
sleep 1

# Up to the top bar and right to the rules header, which says the rules a
# new save starts with; A opens Custom Rules on its first row, with the hint.
# Input is ignored there for 20 frames.
search ': "Rules: 2-minute KO fest!"$' DUp*4 DRight*3
wait 'glide to "Rules: 2-minute KO fest!" ended after \d+ frames: arrived'
press A
wait ': "Custom Rules\. Rules: Time\. Left and right to change\. Compete for points based on KOs and Falls in a timed battle\."$'
sleep 1

# Rules to Stock, read from character select's own string table.
press Right
wait ': "Stock\. Battle to be the last one standing\."$'
press Down
wait ': "Stock: 3\. Set the number of stock lives\."$'

# Down to Item Switch, in and back.
press Down
wait ': "Handicap: Off\. Play without handicaps\."$'
press Down
wait ': "Damage ratio: 1\.0\. The larger the damage ratio, the faster you get KO.d\."$'
press Down
wait ': "Stage selection: On\. Choose stages to battle on\."$'
press Down
wait ': "Item Switch\. Choose how often items will appear and turn specific items on or off\."$'
press A
wait ': "Item Switch\. Food: on\. Up and down to move, left and right to change column, A to turn on or off\."$'
sleep 1
press Down
wait ': "Maxim Tomato: on"$'
press B
wait ': "Custom Rules\. Item Switch\. Choose how often items will appear and turn specific items on or off\."$'
sleep 0.5

# Additional Rules, and from it Random Stage, Up from the first row wrapping
# to the last.
press Down
wait ': "Additional Rules\. Set even more detailed rules\."$'
press A
wait ': "Additional Rules\. Stock match time limit: [^.]+\. Left and right to change\. Set a time limit for Stock Matches\."$'
sleep 1
press Up
wait ': "Random Stage\. If stage selection is set at Random, players will be able to choose stages to exclude\."$'
press A
wait ': "Random Stage\. Princess Peach.s Castle: on\. Up and down to move, left and right to change column, A to turn on or off\."$'
sleep 1
press Down
wait ': "Kongo Jungle: on"$'
press B
wait ': "Additional Rules\. Random Stage\. If stage selection is set at Random, players will be able to choose stages to exclude\."$'
sleep 0.5
press B
wait ': "Custom Rules\. Additional Rules\. Set even more detailed rules\."$'
sleep 0.5

# B back to character select, built afresh with the hand at home.
press B
wait ': "Character select\. Player 1, Fox\."$'
sleep 1

# The header says the new rules; a second visit is an arrival again, with
# the hint, on the Rules row now set to Stock.
search ': "Rules: 3-man survival test!"$' DUp*6 DRight*3
wait 'glide to "Rules: 3-man survival test!" ended after \d+ frames: arrived'
press A
wait ': "Custom Rules\. Rules: Stock\. Left and right to change\. Battle to be the last one standing\."$'
sleep 1

# Back to Time, and Start back to character select.
press Left
wait ': "Time\. Compete for points based on KOs and Falls in a timed battle\."$'
press Start
wait ': "Character select\. Player 1, Fox\."$'
sleep 1
search ': "Rules: 2-minute KO fest!"$' DUp*6 DRight*3
